repository-code: "https://github.com/felipearocha/integrity-code-series-week3-f1-lap-simulation"
url: "https://github.com/felipearocha/integrity-code-series-week3-f1-lap-simulation"
abstract: >
  Physics-informed F1 lap simulation, space-marched along arc length: velocity, ERS state of charge, fuel mass, tyre temperature and tyre wear, with a Gaussian thermal grip window, a first-order spatial aero-mode filter and ERS deploy/regen gate logic. Classical numerics, no ML, no proprietary data. The package is the Week 3 entry in the Integrity Code Series of physics-first integrity simulators by Felipe Rocha.
keywords:
  - lap simulation
  - vehicle dynamics
  - Formula 1
  - tyre thermal model
  - energy recovery system
  - numerical simulation
